      "title": "BANNER DATA STANDARDS MANUAL",
      "url": "https://www.aamu.edu/about/administrative-offices/information-technology-services/support/banner-information/_documents/data-standards-manual.pdf",
      "summary": "The Banner Data Standards Manual at Alabama A&M University outlines data standards for handling university data within the Banner ERP System. The manual covers data confidentiality, stewardship, access, and input processes to ensure data integrity, consistency, and security. The Data Standards Committee and designated Data Stewards play key roles in maintaining these standards. Users must follow specific protocols when accessing or modifying records, ensuring confidentiality per federal acts like FERPA and HIPAA. This document delineates responsibilities and procedures for managing data, striving for accurate university records and facilitating the integrated use of the Banner system across institutional departments.",
      "stored": false,
      "fetched_at": "2026-05-25T13:34:12.922407+05:30"
