      "summary": "The 2015-2025 Strategic Plan for Alabama Agricultural and Mechanical University (AAMU) outlines a decade-long roadmap aimed at enhancing institutional excellence and adapting to dynamic changes in higher education. The plan emphasizes enhancing educational quality, promoting innovation, upgrading infrastructure, and diversifying financial resources. Crafted through comprehensive stakeholder consultations, the plan aims to ensure AAMU remains the institution of choice by focusing on student retention, STEM education, and preparing students for a global economy.",
